WEBVTT

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:00.135
And maybe the DVR.

00:12:00.159 --> 00:12:01.649
(Laughter)

00:12:01.673 --> 00:12:07.175
Lifestyle choices: eating local,
eating lower down the food chain

00:12:07.199 --> 00:12:10.295
and reducing food waste,
which at the global scale,

00:12:10.319 --> 00:12:14.310
is one of the most important things
that we can do to fix this problem.

00:12:14.334 --> 00:12:15.982
I'm a climate scientist,

00:12:16.006 --> 00:12:20.184
so the irony of traveling around
to talk to people about a changing climate

00:12:20.208 --> 00:12:21.820
is not lost on me.

00:12:21.844 --> 00:12:23.135
(Laughter)

00:12:23.755 --> 00:12:27.221
The biggest part of my personal
carbon footprint is my travel.

00:12:27.675 --> 00:12:31.359
And that's why I carefully
collect my invitations.